      "statement": "is_bot_token_only_mode() is true when LANGSMITH_API_KEY is set but neither X_SERVICE_AUTH_JWT_SECRET nor USER_ID_API_KEY_MAP is configured, meaning per-user OAuth tokens cannot be resolved and the GitHub App installation token is used for git operations.",
