      "id": "claim_4b6072a42f794538a01173c5870118b9",
      "statement": "enforce_org_login_gate treats a nonempty ALLOWED_GITHUB_ORGS allowlist as fail-closed: it allows only an active member of at least one listed org, checking membership with a GitHub App installation token and rejecting API/token/membership failures; when the allowlist is empty it intentionally fails open but logs once per process that any GitHub account may log in and all logged-in users can read surfaced threads.",
